<description>&lt;p&gt;Militant groups in Cabo Delgado freed fishermen they had been holding captive, ending a recent hostage situation. Islamist insurgents continued to attack civilians and clash with Mozambican security forces, and a blogger was killed while livestreaming an expose of chromium pollution on a Mozambican road. Chapo called for cooperation to protect Africa’s strategic minerals, linking mineral security to the conflict zone. The insurgency caused 151 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Businessday NG&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxQRkQ4WjNpUnI4RURmS05MU2N3RGZDZi1KYUNvX05JdHliVDlCTlRGeWdzYXZlUGZ4WGZHdUlHVTZlU2J2dExZRXY2VzdqMzhDdUlrSXM4cGpSZTdJM2tZaUlXM0tDUTh6LWZNRjJqYm9ydnN1VkV1Z1FtbktRMURQeVI5Q1h5bVZQd0ZIc3B4ay1RMldYUUMtMWdaUWw5T2lVODVXZE5UdWNxZjA0UmpMc3ZiU1V3Rl8zZWN3Z1N5bVp1c2Q4U3c?oc=5&quot;&gt;www.christiandaily.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ACI Africa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxPZHo0NWJJTmNfQTdtWHg2R3NONF9oX0NrQUdBcDlLaTkyOGtjbmFQZm5OOGlzY1VCc0gzSUwwc2lub1hZNHFOR256Wmw0M01Vb19zeVFOS3J1aURfLWZfYm0yaGh2eFVSSlVwanhJX1pVRnlxZHp5T3o4MXVXVkczME5OTGNtQ1M1blhSZGRxTW4zVm95cThwUTZ4Y1p3MEl3ZjZTcjZaZW5oQjVSYlNUQmE3NU9vdW1HQ0R1RWtn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Club of Mozambique&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxOcmJEM2RVWlVPRHYzbnJ5UHFDR2FKazZjYVJrYTdRNE93S2pHaTJmUEtfZFZVX3NJNElLa09ubndQVGxCV25XdV92QmZrdnlKQnpOM2E2enZ3YWs1OFh1RkJIc2oxaG9tbDJ2SV9iLU92SndaV1E3eVVBWXRpdC1iWXR5bkVzYTBqSS1WUG5felhvQUxNaEpMZVl2U0ZRVlBxRkYyc081NA?oc=5&quot;&gt;African Times&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
